	(text "Versa expansion header X4: 2x20 male on the Versa, 2x20 female socket J1 on the bottom of this board.\nPin names per Lattice FPGA-EB-02021 table 12 with the FPGA ball. IO24..IO28, RESOUT# and CARDSEL# are not used.\n3V3 comes from the single 3V3 pin of X4 (pin 20) through F1; the X4 GND pins are tied together on the board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0a4290be-4a80-5c37-ab3b-5c284187b403")
	)
	(text "Pmod host ports J2..J4, pin numbers as in the Pmod Interface Specification 1.3.1 (1-6 upper row, 7-12 lower row).\nSymbol pins are in connector column order: pins n and n+6 share a column and are one ECP5 differential pair\n(A = pin 1..4, B = pin 7..10), except PB2/PB8 (IO10/IO11). PB2 = IO10 = PCLKT1_1 (primary clock input).\n33 ohm series resistors in every signal (source termination, current limit). 12-bit DVI Pmod: its J2 on PMOD A, its J1 on PMOD B."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 140.97 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e2435713-64f2-5886-b3fe-77a3cd6ba48d")
	)
